  "explanation": "The question asks when the 'Turkish Republican Party' was founded. Two distinct entities appear in the sources: (1) the Republican Party in Turkey, mentioned in D1S4 and D1S5, which was founded on 4 September 1972; and (2) the Republican Turkish Party (CTP) in Northern Cyprus, mentioned in D4S2, which was founded in 1970. These are separate political entities with similar names. Both claims are supported directly by their respective sources and should be preserved as valid referents. The Republican Party in Turkey and the Republican Turkish Party (CTP) in Northern Cyprus are distinct, and the question does not specify which one is intended. Therefore, both founding dates are valid and complementary."
